{"id":"661274","name":"豆沙糯米糍","author":"伊悠悠","authorId":"230225","desc":"","cover":"images/661274/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"糯米粉","amount":"120g"},{"name":"玉米淀粉","amount":"40g"},{"name":"白砂糖","amount":"30g"},{"name":"牛奶","amount":"160g"}],"sub":[{"name":"食用油","amount":"8g"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"糯米粉120克，玉米淀粉40克，白砂糖30克，加牛奶160克。","img":"images/661274/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"搅拌均匀。","img":"images/661274/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"盖上盖子，再盖上蒸锅盖，大火蒸20分钟。","img":"images/661274/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"加食用油8克，待温揉匀成团。","img":"images/661274/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"戴手套操作，取一半面团，用手擀平，抹上豆沙。","img":"images/661274/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"卷起来均匀切块。","img":"images/661274/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"裹上椰蓉。","img":"images/661274/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"即可。","img":"images/661274/step_8.jpg"}],"tips":"豆沙糯米糍。如果吃不完，可以冷冻保存，跟冻饺子是一样的。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}